    "markdown": "---\ntitle: Bogotá\ncategories:\n - Colombia\n - Congresos\n - Familia\n---\n\n\n\nPara mis padres fue un hogar durante 10 años. De visita en varias oportunidades, Bogotá nos recibió cuando buscabamos camino. Fue nuestro puente entre Venezuela y Australia.\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n<center>\n<img src='https://live.staticflickr.com/2743/4496733762_747cf50b46.jpg' width='333'  height='500' class='preview-image'>\n<br/>\n<strong>¡Chócala!</strong> by <a href='https://www.flickr.com/photos/76585510@N00/4496733762' target='flickr'>¡Fgz! @ flickr</a><br/></center>\n\n\n\n\n## Galería de fotos\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"htmlwidget-5ac29ed50c0991a4fa06\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;\" class=\"pixgallery html-widget\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-5ac29ed50c0991a4fa06\">{\"x\":{\"path\":[\"https://live.staticflickr.com/2743/4496733762_747cf50b46.jpg\",\"https://live.staticflickr.com/4008/4496134335_d86fb78fa2.jpg\",\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/53428468781_0c2837cc98.jpg\"],\"caption\":[\"<strong>¡Chócala!<\\/strong> by <a href='https://www.flickr.com/photos/76585510@N00/4496733762' target='flickr'>¡Fgz! @ flickr<\\/a>\",\"<strong>Gael en el tren<\\/strong> by <a href='https://www.flickr.com/photos/76585510@N00/4496134335' target='flickr'>¡Fgz! @ flickr<\\/a>\",\"<strong>ArtBo<\\/strong> by <a href='https://www.flickr.com/photos/199798864@N08/53428468781' target='flickr'>ceba.lee @ flickr<\\/a>\"],\"caption_valign\":\"none\",\"caption_halign\":\"left\",\"link\":[true],\"h\":null,\"w\":null,\"gap\":\"5px\",\"border_radius\":\"0px\",\"layout\":\"grid\",\"shuffle\":false},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"imgur-embed-pub\" lang=\"en\" data-id=\"IsKcZNg\"><a href=\"https://imgur.com/IsKcZNg\">View post on imgur.com</a></blockquote><script async src=\"//s.imgur.com/min/embed.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"><